  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Choose <a href={thinkificUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Thinkific</a> if</strong> the course itself is the product — multiple courses, certificates, structured learning — and you want the LMS features without tier-hopping. <strong>Skip Thinkific if</strong> your buyers are mostly in the EU and you expected VAT to be fully handled, or if $82/mo before your first sale is a stretch; it did not used to cost this much, and it may not stay this price either.
  </p>
  <p>
